  Body
    Paragraph
      Text "Markdown has no grammar. This post walks through what that means in practice."
    Paragraph
      Text "<!--more-->"
    Section level=2
      Heading
        Text "Why it is hard"
      Paragraph
        Text "Three things get in the way:"
      Paragraph
        Text "1. Indentation decides which block a line belongs to.\n2. A reference link depends on a definition elsewhere.\n3. Emphasis follows rules about the characters around it."
